RuneScape Wiki-derived facts and adaptations — open-f2p 0.5.0

The facts, coordinates, location joins and generated descriptions in dataset.json
and baseline-0.1.0.json / baseline-0.2.0.json / baseline-0.3.0.json /
baseline-0.4.0.json
are adapted from the RuneScape Wiki, https://runescape.wiki/, by its contributors.
