https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/

Every cell, source, task, shop, stock row, bank, deposit box, route, walking
connection, quest, achievement, equipment item, monster, drop, facility,
recipe, acquisition and reviewed exclusion records its source page title,
revision ID and revision URL. buildInputs records the pinned API cache receipts.
Changes: select an explicitly limited F2P surface slice; derive 64-tile region keys
from Wiki tile coordinates; aggregate placements by resource and region; write
new task descriptions; curate named walking paths, banking services, positive
F2P shop stock and a conditional boat route; expand reviewed trees, surface mines,
fishing and walking approaches; adapt quests, achievements and their gates;
select exact free equipment variants, monster locations, drop quantities/rates
and material/tool/facility requirements for reviewed production recipes.
The original 0.1.0 through 0.4.0 gameplay rows are retained in their respective
baseline files for identity checks.

